# Entry points are GENERATED per machine by installer-shims.ps1, from the
# editors actually installed there. Committing one for every editor we can
# think of would shadow commands that are not installed: typing `cursor` on a
# machine without Cursor would answer with a DevContext error instead of
# "command not found".
#
# Hence an allowlist rather than a pattern: everything here is generated unless
# it is named below. A file that appears in `git status` is a file somebody
# added by hand and needs to decide about.
*
!.gitignore
!supabase
!supabase.cmd
!supabase.ps1
!editor.ps1
